<div class="badge success-badge">🎉 Project Created</div>

<h1 class="title">Project Created Successfully</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Your project <strong>{{projectName}}</strong> is ready in DeployIO. You can configure environments and deploy when you're ready.</p>

<div class="feature-list">
  <h3>Project Details</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Project:</strong> {{projectName}}</li>
    <li><strong>Created:</strong> {{timestamp}}</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<p style="color: #a3a3a3; margin: 24px 0; font-size: 14px;">
  Open your project dashboard to manage deployments, environment variables, and settings.
</p>

{{#if actionUrl}}
{{> button url=actionUrl label="View Project"}}
{{else if dashboardUrl}}
{{> button url=dashboardUrl label="View Project"}}
{{/if}}
